OL,3,AMen held in major incident near RAF
OL,4,Abase as homes evacuated
OL,5,
OL,6,FA major incident has been declared near
OL,7,FRAF Fairford and several men have been
OL,8,Farrested on suspicion of offences under
OL,9,Fthe Explosives Act, Gloucestershire
OL,10,Fpolice say
OL,12,FResidents in a nearby village have been
OL,13,Fevacuated to a leisure centre while
OL,14,Finvestigations continue - officers say
OL,15,Fthey believe the incident is contained
OL,17,FA spokesperson for the US Air Force -
OL,18,Fwho have used the military base to
OL,19,Fdeploy American bombers during the
OL,20,Fongoing conflict with Iran - says its
OL,21,Fpersonnel "remain vigilant"
OL,23,APub: 27-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG5/40
