OL,3,AControversial Drumcree Orange Order
OL,4,Amarch delayed as protesters block road
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Orange Order, the most prominent of
OL,7,Fthe loyal orders associated with
OL,8,FProtestants, say the Garvaghy Road is
OL,9,Fpart of its traditional marching route
OL,10,Fbut the event is opposed by many
OL,11,FCatholic residents who live there
OL,13,FSunday's parade comes after 24 hours of
OL,14,Flegal drama that went into the early
OL,15,Fhours of Sunday, with the High Court
OL,16,Fruling that an initial decision to
OL,17,Fallow the march to take place had to be
OL,18,Frespected
OL,23,APub: 27-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG8/40
